      "act": "Manim exhibit — Geiger-Nuttall law across nuclides",
      "narration_text": "The chart of nuclides: each nucleus plotted by its alpha decay energy on the x-axis and the logarithm of its decay constant on the y-axis. The points fall on a straight line. Ra-226 at low energy, long half-life. Po-212 at high energy, nanosecond half-life. The line spans 20 orders of magnitude of half-life variation — and it is straight.",
